[background arg="res://assets/unsorted/black.png" fade="0.0"]
join anemon left [animation="Instant In"]
join brochette right [animation="Slide From Right"]
join pirhana rightmost [animation="Slide From Right"]
anemon: Hello we're Anne and Joe,  the detectives in charge of the investigation, and we'd like to ask you a few questions.
brochette: I'm Brochette and this is my husband Pirhana. We were quite shocked to learn of Shrimp's terrible accident.
pirhana: Yes
anemon: We're not so sure it was an accident actually.
brochette: What are you implying ?
anemon: We have reasons to believe it may have been a murder. What were you doing yesterday evening ?
brochette: Are you suspecting me ?
joe: This is a closed space ma'am, everyone is a suspect.
anemon:  And we were asking your husband as well, unless you have something to confess ?
brochette: Yes I do! My necklace has disapeared! I had left it in my room as usual and it is not there anymore. Considering it's a closed space, as you so kindly pointed out, it must have been stolen! See I am a victim here, not a murderer! Isn't that right dear ?
pirhana: Yes.
brochette: I think they should apologize.
pirhana: Yes.
joe: We will, at the end of the investigation. Unless you happen to be associated with the crime or witheld critical information of course.
anemon: In the meantime, could you describe that necklace for us please ?
brochette: DESCRIBE NECKLACE
pirhana: Yes
anemon: And what did you do yesterday evening ?
brochette: We ate with everyone in the refectory and then came to our room. That's when I found out my necklace had disappeared. Thinking it had been my husdand who misplaced it we got into some argument.
pirhana: Yes
brochette: But we eventually sorted it out. Isn't that right ?
pirhana: Yes
brochette: After that we simply slept and here you were.
pirhana: Yes
anemon: Are you always so short in your replies Pirhana ?
brochette: Yes he is!
set {NextDialogue.couple} = "nothing_whale"